  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Something that'd help cut down on the use of Contact components for more complex avatars is if we could use a checkbox (ie boolean) toggle to enable and disable specific tags on a Contact Sender or Receiver and drive that via an animation.\nEg;  I have an avatar with a \"laser tag\" system that can shoot other avatars with the same system.  If I want to change it so it can do team battles (eg; Shoot players set to be on \"Team B\" but not \"Team A\", I have to use two extra sets of Contact Senders and Receivers that will only interact with the other team's.  This does not scale well.\nIf I could toggle the Collision tags on the component, I could use a single set of Senders and Receivers and simply enable the Tags I need.",
